[{"client_msg_id":"8101a77c-7485-45f8-aae2-1beabf22e11d","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"「「もしかして、私達、インデックスずれてる！？」」","ts":"1636539104.367600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"fuita","count":5,"users":["U7JL1UKKL","UD1FQV38V","U02G79NJMLY","UGH7U3SF2","U8CC7MDCL"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CBn1E"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2ECA6F9B-4CDB-4748-8B00-0FFD6E3F1399","type":"message","user":"U02AJP5L75Z","text":"-rangeとgetlineでインデックスズレてる…？そんなことが…？","ts":"1636538952.367100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"76lW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fb6032d6-c160-40fb-83cc-adc7c13bdb55","type":"message","user":"UGH7U3SF2","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/skanehira/translate.vim/issues/11#issuecomment-964015782\u003e\nどうしてこうなるのかがわからないです...","ts":"1636535837.365500","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/skanehira/translate.vim/issues/11#issuecomment-964015782|Comment on #11 When translate n lines I get only n-1 lines.\u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/skanehira/translate.vim/issues/11#issuecomment-964015782|Comment on #11 When translate n lines I get only n-1 lines.\u003e","text":"今確認したところ再び発生してしまっていることを確認しました。  \nWindows10  \nvim 8.2.2344 8.2.2501 8.2.3013 8.2.3582\n\n```\nset nocompatible\nset rtp+=~/test/translate.vim\nlet g:translate_source = \"en\"\nlet g:translate_target = \"ja\"\nlet g:translate_winsize = 10\nvmap tj \u0026lt;Plug\u0026gt;(VTranslate)\nvmap te \u0026lt;Plug\u0026gt;(VTranslateBang)\n\n```\n\nこの設定で:Translateを一行に対して行うと結果はない複数行で行うと選択した行よりも一行少ないものが翻訳されてしまうという状態でした。  \nなおneovimで試した場合は問題なく実行できました。","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/skanehira/translate.vim|skanehira/translate.vim\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png","ts":1636453674}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8qYOR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cb2eeace-0350-4d8b-b288-0e4597d8dbae","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"プレビュー領域のせいで候補が見えないやつか","ts":"1636535395.364100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LEKGw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2edc0884-e945-43c6-9994-8db4f7407530","type":"message","user":"UML2DU3TK","text":"昨日、ついに telescope の preview を toggle にする action が追加されました。\nまだ、試せてないのですが、ファイルパスが長いときの不満が解消されそうです。\n\u003chttps://github.com/nvim-telescope/telescope.nvim/pull/1305\u003e","ts":"1636534822.363500","attachments":[{"color":"6f42c1","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/nvim-telescope/telescope.nvim/pull/1305|#1305 feat: add hide / unhide preview\u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/nvim-telescope/telescope.nvim/pull/1305|#1305 feat: add hide / unhide preview\u003e","text":"Add new options:\n\n• to hide and unhide preview leaving just results and prompt.\n• ~to hide and unhide results and prompt leaving just preview window active. Active preview buffer inherits autocmd for `BufLeave` and config mappings from prompt which makes it possible to also cycle through previews.~ This feature will be introduced in another PR\n\nExample key mapping:\n\n```\nrequire(\"telescope\").setup({\n\tdefaults = {\n\t\tmappings = {\n\t\t\tn = {\n\t\t\t\t[\"\u0026lt;C-h\u0026gt;\"] = actions.toggle_preview,\n\t\t\t\t[\"\u0026lt;C-j\u0026gt;\"] = actions.toggle_results_and_prompt,\n\t\t\t},\n\t\t\ti = {\n\t\t\t\t[\"\u0026lt;C-h\u0026gt;\"] = actions.toggle_preview,\n\t\t\t\t[\"\u0026lt;C-j\u0026gt;\"] = actions.toggle_results_and_prompt,\n\t\t\t},\n               }\n       }\n})\n```\n\nThis still require little tweaks for example I am not really sure how should I keep selection ( or if it is currently possible ) for specific entry when hiding preview in vertical layout because the size of results window changes and picker refresh also change the order of results.","fields":[{"title":"Comments","value":"39","short":true}],"mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/nvim-telescope/telescope.nvim|nvim-telescope/telescope.nvim\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png","ts":1633383003}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"blob_tada","count":1,"users":["UFP0GQZ4K"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ad6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7460ea36-3856-4cd6-8983-652fbe8a5fc0","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"fooenv でインストールすると、 `libfoo.so` を作り漏らしてなくなく再インストールしたり…(n敗 n \u0026gt;3 )","ts":"1636531532.361800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["UD1FQV38V"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7HlG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"06b4ea74-64e9-4ebf-a012-2c01de71fa20","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"そういや、開発環境が制限的なところでPython+PyInstallerでの単体ツール作るときに、がんばってライブラリもコンパイルしたなあ","ts":"1636530644.359700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0Ndu9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"55e621f5-9181-4bee-bb6b-fa33f5569573","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"この例だとOSの中のパッケージが足りない場合とかかな","ts":"1636530445.359000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"T5bj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e28a109f-7a25-4ad9-8499-c95cc66e3441","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"例えばこういう話とか \u003chttps://blog.amedama.jp/entry/2018/08/25/134642\u003e","ts":"1636530402.358300","attachments":[{"fallback":"CUBE SUGAR CONTAINER: ソースコードから Python をインストールするときにビルドされないモジュールを確認する - CUBE SUGAR CONTAINER","id":1,"title":"ソースコードから Python をインストールするときにビルドされないモジュールを確認する - CUBE SUGAR CONTAINER","title_link":"https://blog.amedama.jp/entry/2018/08/25/134642","text":"ソースコードから Python をインストールするとき、環境によってはビルドされないモジュールが出てくる。 今回は、どんなモジュールがビルドされなかったかを確認する方法について。 先に結論から書くと、ビルドされなかったモジュールがあるときはログにメッセージが残る。 使った環境は次の通り。 $ cat /etc/lsb-release DISTRIB_ID=Ubuntu DISTRIB_RELEASE=18.04 DISTRIB_CODENAME=bionic DISTRIB_DESCRIPTION=\"Ubuntu 18.04.1 LTS\" $ uname -r 4.15.0-20-generi…","thumb_url":"https://images-fe.ssl-images-amazon.com/images/I/415QwBMiAcL._SL160_.jpg","blocks":null,"ts":1535172402,"service_name":"CUBE SUGAR CONTAINER","service_icon":"https://blog.amedama.jp/icon/touch","thumb_width":100,"thumb_height":160,"from_url":"https://blog.amedama.jp/entry/2018/08/25/134642","original_url":"https://blog.amedama.jp/entry/2018/08/25/134642"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"totemoturai","count":2,"users":["UGN0T63GC","U06ECBRTJ"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jWn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a41c5ad4-2c30-47f1-8988-07466fbc7b1a","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"Python の独自ビルドはかれこれずっとやってないんですが(僕も過去にpyenv使ってた時期ありました)。configure で雑にネットで拾ってきたやつとか使ったりすると。ビルドは成功しても、標準ライブラリの中でも使えない状態になってるライブラリとかもたしかありますよね。そういう罠があったような気が... (気の所為かもですが)","ts":"1636530333.358100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"l/DFf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b1bdff97-d876-4469-98c0-e1ec2f5bc416","type":"message","user":"UGN0T63GC","text":"自分で複数バージョンインストールする方法だと PATH とか PYTHONPATH あたりの切り替えが手間なので…","ts":"1636530114.357800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"frOj8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e143ddf6-a6ad-4953-853d-b307e3dee6b7","type":"message","user":"UGN0T63GC","text":"マイナーバージョンまで区別して個別インストールできるディストリとかは、パッケージマネージャ側が管理しきれないでしょうね。\n私はあきらめて、asdf (以前は pyenv) + pipx + poetry で管理してます。","ts":"1636530060.356600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rb1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"89afa087-7e6d-4e51-bc0b-f7fbc6654544","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"Mac は公式インストーラーをポチポチすれば勝手にバージョン違いで入ってくれる。Winはなんか色々ありそうですが py ランチャーみたいな謎のソリューションで切り替えたりとかもあるので。なんかOS別に、事情が色々ありますね...","ts":"1636529957.355000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zC6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d5f64759-37bb-4bb1-aed6-7fd6230fb3cc","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"Linux ではパッケージマネージャーに依存しない場合は結局Pythonのビルドは必須になると思うので pyenv でもいいんじゃないですかね。pyenv 自体は使わずに pyenv の中の python-build だけは使うとかそういう方法もあるようですし、手動でゴニョゴニョする方法あるとは思いますが \u003chttps://www.python.jp/install/ubuntu/index.html\u003e","ts":"1636529765.353800","attachments":[{"fallback":"Ubuntu環境のPython - python.jp","id":1,"title":"Ubuntu環境のPython - python.jp","title_link":"https://www.python.jp/install/ubuntu/index.html","text":"Ubuntu には最初からPythonがインストールされており、そのまま利用可能です。 しかし、このPython は、 OS がさまざまな機能を提供するために使用しています。ユーザが勝手にパッケージを導入したりすると、 OS の安定性を損なうことも考えられますので、別途","thumb_url":"https://www.python.jp/static/pythonjp/images/logo_red_120.png","blocks":null,"service_name":"python.jp","service_icon":"https://www.python.jp/static/pythonjp/images/favicon_32.png","thumb_width":120,"thumb_height":40,"from_url":"https://www.python.jp/install/ubuntu/index.html","original_url":"https://www.python.jp/install/ubuntu/index.html"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":3,"users":["UD1FQV38V","UGN0T63GC","U8CC7MDCL"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9oB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"73df7503-0543-4191-87e4-bcbdb6b3e0ea","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"snap や appimage のようなインストーラーがいいんですかね","ts":"1636529483.353200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"s0o6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c7115582-6e2f-47d1-8aa8-f74b3a3725b0","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"マイナー違いで簡単(安心安全で他に色々影響しない)に入れられるディストリがあるなら良さそうですね","ts":"1636529417.352200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"E9P"}