etions on a nonexisting file outside your home directory\u003e","text":"*Problem*\n\nddc-file does not provide filenames when all of the following conditions have met:\n\n• vim8\n• not at a normal file (e.g. deol-edit buffer)\n• not at your home directory\n\n\u003chttps://asciinema.org/a/rIvUFnqEAJhzm5stMSLu1KUUM|https://asciinema.org/a/rIvUFnqEAJhzm5stMSLu1KUUM\u003e\n\n*Solution*\n\nThis patch is not beautiful at all but it solves the problem.\n\n\u003chttps://asciinema.org/a/J3F5dGk85AOY8m6rxN5A1cVJE|https://asciinema.org/a/J3F5dGk85AOY8m6rxN5A1cVJE\u003e\n\n*Known issue*\n\nIt keeps the files at the previous directory too...","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/LumaKernel/ddc-file|LumaKernel/ddc-file\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png","ts":1636501506}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kbP9b"}]},{"client_msg_id":"73b0c9e5-08a9-4ba6-97dc-e8182d74a3f4","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"候補を一回全部捨ててやる必要があるか","ts":"1636501348.309700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uuP1E"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9e85ab00-34e8-4506-9841-5d96d4a4d2b3","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"つまりここはcd時のハンドリングが足りてないか","ts":"1636501318.309200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kNZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dc34b9ee-e50e-4f01-9e62-93b5d03b7924","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"~確かに、trueにしててもVim内でcdすると補完候補が変わらない~\nここがujihisaさんの修正で対応された所だった","ts":"1636501257.308700","edited":{"user":"U01D44KSY9Z","ts":"1636501397.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Utwx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b22fcad4-c13e-4d5f-800f-0892451e65e5","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/ujihisa/config/blob/master/_vimrc#L3099\u003e","ts":"1636501210.308000","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/ujihisa/config/blob/master/_vimrc | _vimrc\u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/ujihisa/config/blob/master/_vimrc | _vimrc\u003e","text":"```\n            \\   'isVolatile': v:true,\n```","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/ujihisa/config|ujihisa/config\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lbC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"85ef620a-e14c-4414-bccf-a79d8105c0ef","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"といいつつ実は僕もisVolatileをv:trueにしてました","ts":"1636501183.307700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HSDt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ac2e3bfb-c434-410c-ba22-31d92e49f99b","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"あああ、なるほど!","ts":"1636501167.307400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6Y7J"}]},{"type":"message","user":"UPZHKAM7W","text":"```\n                                        *ddc-source-option-isVolatile*\nisVolatile              (boolean)\n                If it is True, ddc refresh candidates always.\n \n                Default: v:false\n```","ts":"1636501160.307200","bot_id":"BPM858KEE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"3c3fc23a-197c-4e2d-93b7-ee61a8628b90","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":":h ddc-source-option-isVolatile","ts":"1636501160.307100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9HaHU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"454227c6-f5d8-4b41-9096-636ab50e72e5","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"ちなみに僕の設定です\n```    \\ 'file': {\n    \\   'mark': 'F',\n    \\   'isVolatile': v:true,\n    \\   'forceCompletionPattern': '\\S/\\S*',\n    \\   'matchers': ['matcher_head'],\n    \\   'sorters': ['sorter_ascii'],\n    \\   'converters': [],\n    \\ },```\n`isVolatile` ですかね","ts":"1636501110.306800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UEL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d2408793-ea0a-4ab9-9548-e99a8afad8d2","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"とりあえずまあ話だけかいてもあれなのでコードをざっと投げてそこから直していこっと","ts":"1636501061.306400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=uV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1d6ae528-7ecd-4980-acc0-f2e6cc829656","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"どこかのレイヤでなんらかのキャッシュをしているとみた","ts":"1636501049.305700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LwRq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"635b476f-f5d9-46c5-9d52-2adcf6c668d7","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"パッチあてて、たとえば~/から~/bbbにcdしてもいけるようにしてみたけど、そうすると~/と~/bbbにある両方のファイルすべてが補完候補に","ts":"1636501032.305300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jaq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bfddf2f0-04ee-4796-ac32-2cfa1989e461","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"途中でcdしたとき、補完候補が置き換わらず、単に増える","ts":"1636500998.304400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tI/c"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bf2ad0c3-2b46-4902-9d0f-fbc04deca117","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"おかしいな","ts":"1636500991.304100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IR6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0efd9491-05b4-4606-98c1-ad2667263332","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"ほんとですね\nprojectRoot関係かとも思ったけどgitリポジトリ外でも普通に補完効いた、謎","ts":"1636500628.303900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":fals