nclude\n    │   ├── lib\n    │   └── share\n    └── Current -\u0026gt; 3.10\n\n31 directories, 4 files```","ts":"1636526218.343900","thread_ts":"1636526037.341500","parent_user_id":"UD1FQV38V","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"er60"}]},{"client_msg_id":"40b2cd4a-ed70-49d0-ac67-50a3b13ed56c","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"これはどういう意味？","ts":"1636505225.324700","thread_ts":"1636502649.319000","parent_user_id":"U01D44KSY9Z","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8kEC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b8c1f458-f9c3-410e-b12c-634189ba0a40","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"buf_pathの候補を出したくないということ？","ts":"1636505251.324900","thread_ts":"1636502649.319000","parent_user_id":"U01D44KSY9Z","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DuT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e013e7d6-c986-4860-a060-a28c1dcfdbad","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"ddc-fileをリポジトリ内で動かすとcwdとは別にプロジェクトルートからの候補が出てるように見えていたのですが、違うのでしょうか？","ts":"1636511574.327400","thread_ts":"1636502649.319000","parent_user_id":"U01D44KSY9Z","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4AmJ2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a0ec624e-e933-4257-9d23-1b898317dbe6","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"あー、なるほど。そういう機能があるのは知らなかった","ts":"1636511716.327600","thread_ts":"1636502649.319000","parent_user_id":"U01D44KSY9Z","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2v4gu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a6a4b31d-4a7c-4bb8-9cac-8f940a4f2571","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"まあリポジトリルートから動かないスタイルだと気付かないですね\n僕も存在は知ってましたが、実際にやってみてこういう挙動なのかと思いました","ts":"1636517711.327800","thread_ts":"1636502649.319000","parent_user_id":"U01D44KSY9Z","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":f